
---
---

<section class="benefits-section">
  <div class="benefits-container">

    <div class="benefits-header">
      <div>
        <span class="benefits-eyebrow">
          <span class="benefits-dot"></span>
          02 / EL RESULTADO
        </span>

        <h2>
          Menos operación manual.
          <span>Más negocio.</span>
        </h2>
      </div>

      <p>
        La automatización no sustituye lo que haces bien.
        Elimina las tareas que te impiden hacerlo mejor.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="benefits-dashboard">

      <article class="benefit-main">
        <div class="benefit-main-top">
          <span class="benefit-tag">01 — PRODUCTIVIDAD</span>
          <span class="benefit-symbol">↗</span>
        </div>

        <div class="benefit-main-content">
          <div class="benefit-visual">
            <div class="visual-ring ring-one"></div>
            <div class="visual-ring ring-two"></div>
            <div class="visual-center">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none">
                <path d="M32 8V18M32 46V56M8 32H18M46 32H56"
                  stroke="#A78BFA" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <path d="M22 32L29 39L43 24"
                  stroke="#22D3EE" stroke-width="3"
                  stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3>Recupera tu tiempo</h3>
            <p>
              Deja que el sistema se encargue de enviar recordatorios,
              solicitar confirmaciones y dar seguimiento.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="benefit-main-footer">
          <span class="benefit-live-dot"></span>
          MENOS TAREAS REPETITIVAS
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="benefit-card">
        <span class="benefit-card-number">02</span>
        <div class="benefit-icon">◷</div>
        <h3>Agenda más organizada</h3>
        <p>
          Facilita las confirmaciones y reagendaciones para reducir
          los espacios vacíos.
        </p>
        <span class="benefit-card-label">RECORDATORIOS AUTOMÁTICOS</span>
      </article>

      <article class="benefit-card">
        <span class="benefit-card-number">03</span>
        <div class="benefit-icon">↻</div>
        <h3>Clientes que regresan</h3>
        <p>
          Contacta a quienes llevan tiempo sin visitar tu negocio
          y recupera oportunidades.
        </p>
        <span class="benefit-card-label">SEGUIMIENTO INTELIGENTE</span>
      </article>

      <article class="benefit-card">
        <span class="benefit-card-number">04</span>
        <div class="benefit-icon">✧</div>
        <h3>Más confianza en Google</h3>
        <p>
          Facilita que tus clientes satisfechos compartan su experiencia
          y ayuden a otros a encontrarte.
        </p>
        <span class="benefit-card-label">GESTIÓN DE RESEÑAS</span>
      </article>

      <article class="benefit-card">
        <span class="benefit-card-number">05</span>
        <div class="benefit-icon">⌁</div>
        <h3>Decisiones con claridad</h3>
        <p>
          Revisa confirmaciones, reagendaciones y reseñas para entender
          qué está funcionando.
        </p>
        <span class="benefit-card-label">SEGUIMIENTO MEDIBLE</span>
      </article>

    </div>

    <div class="benefits-bottom">
      <span>WEB WIZARDS / AUTOMATIZACIÓN</span>
      <span>SISTEMAS DISEÑADOS PARA TU NEGOCIO <span class="bottom-arrow">↗</span></span>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .benefits-section {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 115px 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 85% 15%, rgba(34,211,238,.055), transparent 35%),
      #0b0b14;
  }

  .benefits-container {
    width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 48px));
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .benefits-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: end;
    gap: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 55px;
  }

  .benefits-eyebrow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    color: #a78bfa;
    font-size: .7rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .15em;
  }

  .benefits-dot {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #22d3ee;
    box-shadow: 0 0 12px #22d3ee;
  }

  .benefits-header h2 {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0;
    color: #f4f2ff;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.2rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -.065em;
    line-height: 1.05;
  }

  .benefits-header h2 span {
    display: block;
    background: linear-gradient(100deg, #a78bfa, #8b5cf6, #22d3ee);
    background-clip: text;
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
  }

  .benefits-header > p {
    max-width: 340px;
    margin: 0 0 5px;
    color: #a3a2b9;
    font-size: .95rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .benefits-dashboard {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 15px;
  }

  .benefit-main,
  .benefit-card {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(167,139,250,.15);
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, #151425, #10101b);
    transition: border-color .3s, transform .3s;
  }

  .benefit-main:hover,
  .benefit-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    border-color: rgba(167,139,250,.42);
  }

  .benefit-main {
    grid-row: span 2;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    min-height: 370px;
    padding: 27px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 50% 45%, rgba(139,92,246,.16), transparent 48%),
      linear-gradient(145deg, #19152c, #10101b);
  }

  .benefit-main-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .benefit-tag,
  .benefit-main-footer,
  .benefit-card-label {
    color: #a4a1bd;
    font-size: .63rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .12em;
  }

  .benefit-symbol {
    color: #22d3ee;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }

  .benefit-main-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 22px;
  }

  .benefit-visual {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 130px;
    height: 130px;
    align-self: center;
  }

  .visual-ring {
    position: absolute;
    border: 1px solid rgba(167,139,250,.24);
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .ring-one {
    width: 130px;
    height: 130px;
    border-style: dashed;
    animation: benefitRotate 25s linear infinite;
  }

  .ring-two {
    width: 95px;
    height: 95px;
    border-color: rgba(34,211,238,.3);
  }

  .visual-center {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 65px;
    height: 65px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(167,139,250,.4);
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: rgba(139,92,246,.13);
    box-shadow: 0 0 35px rgba(139,92,246,.2);
  }

  .visual-center svg {
    width: 40px;
  }

  .benefit-main-content h3 {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 1.65rem;
    letter-spacing: -.04em;
  }

  .benefit-main-content p {
    max-width: 340px;
    margin: 0;
    color: #a3a2b9;
    font-size: .9rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .benefit-main-footer {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;
    padding-top: 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
  }

  .benefit-live-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #22d3ee;
    box-shadow: 0 0 9px #22d3ee;
  }

  .benefit-card {
    min-height: 177px;
    padding: 23px;
  }

  .benefit-card-number {
    position: absolute;
    top: 22px;
    right: 23px;
    color: #77738f;
    font-size: .7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .benefit-icon {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 38px;
    height: 38px;
    margin-bottom: 17px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(167,139,250,.2);
    border-radius: 11px;
    background: rgba(139,92,246,.1);
    color: #a78bfa;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }

  .benefit-card h3 {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    color: #f0efff;
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    letter-spacing: -.02em;
  }

  .benefit-card p {
    margin: 0 0 17px;
    color: #9291a8;
    font-size: .82rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .benefit-card-label {
    display: inline-block;
    color: #8b82b3;
    font-size: .55rem;
  }

  .benefits-bottom {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 28px;
    padding-top: 18px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(167,139,250,.15);
    color: #77758d;
    font-size: .61rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: .1em;
  }

  .bottom-arrow {
    color: #22d3ee;
  }

  @keyframes benefitRotate {
    to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
  }

  @media (max-width: 850px) {
    .benefits-header {
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .benefits-dashboard {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }

    .benefit-main {
      grid-column: span 2;
      grid-row: auto;
      min-height: 330px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 550px) {
    .benefits-section {
      padding: 80px 0;
    }

    .benefits-container {
      width: calc(100% - 36px);
    }

    .benefits-header {
      margin-bottom: 35px;
    }

    .benefits-header h2 {
      font-size: 2.7rem;
    }

    .benefits-dashboard {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .benefit-main {
      grid-column: auto;
      min-height: 350px;
      padding: 22px;
    }

    .benefit-card {
      min-height: 165px;
    }

    .benefits-bottom {
      flex-direction: column;
      font-size: .56rem;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .ring-one {
      animation: none;
    }

    .benefit-main,
    .benefit-card {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
